# Admin Panel & Theme System Overhaul — Walkthrough

## Summary

Migrated all initiative data from static arrays to **Supabase** with full admin CRUD, implemented a **4-theme system** with localStorage persistence, and **overhauled the admin panel UI** with a modern collapsible sidebar, breadcrumbs, and mobile-responsive layout.

## What Changed

### 1. Database Migration (Supabase)

- [009_initiatives_and_programs.sql](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/supabase/migrations/009_initiatives_and_programs.sql) — `programs` and `initiatives` tables with RLS, indexes, triggers
- [010_seed_initiatives.sql](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/supabase/migrations/010_seed_initiatives.sql) — Seed data: 12 programs + 88 initiatives

### 2. Data Layer (Static → Supabase)

- [initiatives.ts](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/lib/data/initiatives.ts) — Complete rewrite from static arrays to Supabase queries
- [database.types.ts](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/lib/database.types.ts) — Added [Program](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/lib/database.types.ts#321-331), [Initiative](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/lib/database.types.ts#332-346), [InitiativeWithProgram](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/lib/database.types.ts#347-350) types

### 3. Four-Theme System

| Theme | Colors |
|-------|--------|
| **Deep Navy** (default) | Navy/Slate/Electric Green |
| **Midnight Purple** | Deep Violet/Purple/Cyan |
| **Carbon** | True Black/Orange/Zinc |
| **Emerald Forest** | Forest Green/Emerald/Gold |

- [ThemeProvider.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/components/ThemeProvider.tsx) — Context with `localStorage` persistence
- [ThemeSwitcher.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/components/ThemeSwitcher.tsx) — Dropdown with color swatches
- [globals.css](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/globals.css) — All theme variables via `[data-theme]` selectors

### 4. Admin Panel Overhaul

- [AdminShell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/components/admin/AdminShell.tsx) — Collapsible sidebar with section groups, active indicators, breadcrumb navigation, mobile hamburger menu, theme switcher
- [InitiativesManager.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/components/admin/InitiativesManager.tsx) — Full CRUD table with search, filter by program, add/edit modal, delete
- [admin/initiatives/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/admin/initiatives/page.tsx) — Admin initiatives listing
- [admin/actions/initiatives.ts](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/admin/actions/initiatives.ts) — Server actions for create/update/delete

