All public initiative pages now query Supabase instead of static data:
- [initiatives/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/initiatives/page.tsx), `[slug]/page.tsx`, [programs/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/initiatives/programs/page.tsx)
